  <!-- Compiled by CI so they cannot rot. The screenshot harness is never RUN by CI — screenshots
       are documentation, not a regression gate (PLAN.md §11 M15) — but the site generator is, by
       .github/workflows/pages.yml, because its command reference is a projection of ActionCatalog
       and a site rebuilt on every push cannot describe a version nobody is running. -->
